From: gaokun-android <local>
Subject: [PATCH] KernelSU: fix task_stack.h version-gated include

【本地，2026-10-11 起】syscall_hook_manager.c 把
`#include <linux/sched/task_stack.h>` 放在
`#if LINUX_VERSION_CODE < KERNEL_VERSION(6, 7, 0)` 里。
本机内核 7.2.9（上游 stable）≥ 6.7.0 ⇒ include 被跳过 ⇒
`task_pt_regs(current)` 展开的 `task_stack_page()` 看不到
`static __always_inline` 定义 ⇒ 链接报 undefined reference。

把 include 移出版本门控（无条件 include）。

---
 kernel/hook/syscall_hook_manager.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kernel/hook/syscall_hook_manager.c b/kernel/hook/syscall_hook_manager.c
--- a/kernel/hook/syscall_hook_manager.c
+++ b/kernel/hook/syscall_hook_manager.c
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@
 #include <linux/version.h>
 #if LINUX_VERSION_CODE < KERNEL_VERSION(6, 7, 0)
 #include <linux/compat.h>
-#include <linux/sched/task_stack.h>
 #endif
+#include <linux/sched/task_stack.h>

 #include "arch.h"
 #include "klog.h" // IWYU pragma: keep
